{"version":1,"key":"card:579","content":{"id":579,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"XSS（Cross-Site Scripting），跨站脚本攻击，为防止与 CSS 缩写混淆，使用了 XSS 的缩写。攻击原理是攻击者通过将恶意代码注入到页面，页面未经处理执行了恶意代码，从而导致用户信息泄露，页面被篡改等问题。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"XSS 主要分为三种类型："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"反射型"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将恶意脚本作为请求参数传递给服务端，服务端未进行过滤，直接将恶意脚本作为网页内容返回，在用户页面执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如制作了一个带恶意代码的 URL 链接，服务端根据 URL 链接上的参数构建了 HTML 页面，包括恶意代码，如果将此链接通过邮件发送给用户，用户一点击就中招"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存储型"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户提交恶意脚本到服务器，并持久化在数据库中，当其他用户访问时，从数据库中取出脚本并被用户页面加载执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如用户通过评论注入恶意脚本，其他用户查看评论时执行了该恶意脚本"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DOM 型"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接修改页面的 DOM，使得脚本在客户端执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如客户端解析 URL 参数时，获取参数后直接插入到了 HTML 中，攻击者就可以将参数内容修改为恶意脚本，直接在页面执行了"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://tech.meituan.com/2018/09/27/fe-security.html","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何防止 XSS 攻击？"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["面试题","安全/XSS"],"createTime":1745218879769,"updateTime":1745424064552,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745424064552}}